@FizzBuzz.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Nominal case
GET {{FizzBuzz.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fizzbuzz?int1=3&int2=5&limit=15&str1=Fizz&str2=Buzz
Accept: application/json

### Unicode and reserved characters must be percent-encoded
GET {{FizzBuzz.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fizzbuzz?int1=2&int2=3&limit=6&str1=C%2B%2B&str2=%F0%9F%98%80
Accept: application/json

### Validation errors (400 ValidationProblemDetails)
GET {{FizzBuzz.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fizzbuzz?int1=0&int2=abc&limit=20000&str1=&str2=Buzz
Accept: application/json

### Liveness
GET {{FizzBuzz.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{FizzBuzz.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{FizzBuzz.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
